Checks every new source against exact Git, original registry, prospective scope,
receipt/state/partial chronology and prior same-lens proof before any mutation.
Uses the previously inspected exclusive historical source writer unchanged
apart from its reviewed Windows serialization and additive adapter reference.
"""
